  <section className="dooh-section"><div className="dooh-wrap"><Head label="ANALYTICS" title="Measure Your Screen Network Without Mixing Measured and Estimated Data."/><div className="dooh-analytics"><div className="dooh-chart"><div className="bars">{[46,72,58,84,62,91,69].map((h,i)=><i key={i} style={{height:`${h}%`}}/>)}</div><small>Illustrative dashboard visual · no live performance numbers</small></div><div className="dooh-metricGrid">{['Campaigns','Bookings','Plays','Screen Utilization','Revenue','Location','Time','Screen','Estimated Impressions','Reach where available'].map(x=><span key={x}><b>{x}</b><i>{x.startsWith('Estimated')||x.startsWith('Reach')?'ESTIMATE / DATA-DEPENDENT':'REPORTING DIMENSION'}</i></span>)}</div></div><p className="dooh-small">Where actual audience measurement is unavailable, use Estimated Reach or Estimated Impressions and clearly identify partner-provided data.</p></div></section>

